WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.740
Down for the Count, a climbing-shedding game where you don't wanna shed.

2
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:08.770
In this game, every card you play brings you closer to being out.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.600
So each turn: play strong to knock out your opponents,

4
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.430
or hold back to outlast them.

5
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.080
Each turn, beat the move on the table with a better one.

6
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.740
Can't beat it? Spend stamina:

7
00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:23.850
you could reverse to take a card off the move into your hand,

8
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.270
or kick out to take a stamina card into your hand.

9
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.810
Out of stamina and you need some? You're pinned.

10
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.950
Play your last card, and you tap out.

11
00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.350
Last wrestler standing wins the round,

12
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.780
and everyone scores by how long they lasted.

13
00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.980
Rounds come down to two wrestlers,

14
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:44.960
each holding a big move, waiting for the other to blink.

15
00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:49.550
Rounds are only about five minutes, so a loss only stings until the next bell.

16
00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.890
The game is made up of sixty cards: ten moves, six of each.

17
00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:57.890
Plays two to five players, in three rounds and ten to fifteen minutes.

18
00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:02.090
Down for the Count. Play it in your browser at darrendon.com,

19
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.850
or email me for a prototype.

